graph TD
    %% ER Stress Triggers
    A[Protein Synthesis Increase] --> B[ER Protein Load]
    C[Mutations in Proteins] --> D[Misfolded Proteins]
    E[Calcium Depletion] --> F[Chaperone Dysfunction]
    G[Reducing Agents DTT] --> H[Disulfide Bond Disruption]
    I[Tunicamycin Treatment] --> J[/Glycosylation Block/]
    
    %% OR Gate 1: ER Stress Detection
    B --> K{OR: Unfolded<br/>Proteins in ER?}
    D --> K
    F --> K
    H --> K
    J --> K
    K -->|No| L[Normal ER Homeostasis]
    K -->|Yes| M[ER Stress Condition]
    
    %% Ire1 Sensing
    M --> N[Ire1 Binds Unfolded Proteins]
    N --> O[Ire1 Oligomerization]
    
    %% AND Gate 1: Ire1 Trans-autophosphorylation
    O --> P{AND: Ire1 Dimers<br/>Formed?}
    P -->|No - Monomers| L
    P -->|Yes - Oligomers| Q[Ire1 Trans-autophosphorylation]
    
    Q --> R[Ire1 Kinase Domain Active]
    R --> S[Ire1 RNase Domain Activated]
    
    %% HAC1 mRNA Splicing
    S --> T[Constitutive HAC1u mRNA]
    T --> U[Ire1 Recognizes Stem-Loops]
    
    %% AND Gate 2: Both Splice Sites
    U --> V{AND: 5' Site<br/>AND 3' Site?}
    V -->|No| W[No Splicing]
    V -->|Yes| X[Ire1 Cleaves Both Sites]
    
    X --> Y[Intron Released]
    Y --> Z[Exon Ligation]
    
    %% AND Gate 3: tRNA Ligase Required
    Z --> AA{AND: Rlg1/Trl1<br/>Ligase Present?}
    AA -->|No| AB[Splicing Incomplete]
    AA -->|Yes| AC[HAC1i mRNA Formed]
    
    %% Translation Difference
    W --> AD[HAC1u has Intron]
    AD --> AE[Translation Stalled]
    AE --> AF[No Hac1 Protein]
    
    AC --> AG[HAC1i mRNA Translated]
    AG --> AH[Hac1 Protein Produced]
    AH --> AI[Hac1 Homodimerization]
    
    %% Nuclear Localization
    AI --> AJ{AND: NLS<br/>Functional?}
    AJ -->|No| AK[Cytoplasmic Retention]
    AJ -->|Yes| AL[Hac1 Nuclear Import]
    
    AL --> AM[Hac1 DNA Binding]
    AM --> AN[UPRE Element Recognition]
    AN --> AO[UPR Target Gene Transcription]
    
    %% OR Gate 2: Which UPR Target?
    AO --> AP{OR: Which Gene<br/>Class?}
    AP -->|Chaperones| AQ[KAR2 PDI1 Expression]
    AP -->|ERAD| AR[DER1 HRD1 Expression]
    AP -->|Lipid Synthesis| AS[INO1 OPI3 Expression]
    AP -->|Quality Control| AT[EUG1 SCJ1 Expression]
    
    %% Chaperone Upregulation
    AQ --> AU[Kar2/BiP Production]
    AU --> AV[Pdi1 Disulfide Isomerase]
    AV --> AW[Enhanced Folding Capacity]
    
    %% ERAD Enhancement
    AR --> AX[Der1 Rhomboid Pseudoprotease]
    AX --> AY[Hrd1 E3 Ubiquitin Ligase]
    AY --> AZ[ERAD Complex Assembly]
    AZ --> BA[/Misfolded Protein Degradation/]
    
    %% ER Expansion
    AS --> BB[Phospholipid Synthesis]
    BB --> BC[ER Membrane Expansion]
    BC --> BD[Increased ER Volume]
    
    %% AND Gate 4: Resolution Check
    AW --> BE{AND: Folding Improved<br/>AND ERAD Active?}
    BA --> BE
    BE -->|No| BF[Sustained UPR]
    BE -->|Yes| BG[ER Stress Resolution]
    
    %% Feedback Inhibition
    BG --> BH[Unfolded Proteins Cleared]
    BH --> BI[Ire1 Deactivation]
    BI --> BJ[No HAC1 Splicing]
    BJ --> BK[Hac1 Protein Decay]
    BK --> BL[/UPR Termination/]
    
    L --> BM([No UPR Needed])
    AF --> BM
    BF --> BN[Chronic ER Stress]
    BN --> BO{OR: Apoptosis<br/>Pathway?}
    BO -->|Yes| BP([Cell Death])
    BO -->|No| BF
    
    %% Normal Resolution
    BD --> BG
    
